### create account
# @name signup
POST http://localhost:8000/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"test-1",
    "account_tag":"human",
    "initial_jpy_balance":1000000
}

### create order
POST http://localhost:8000/accounts/{{signup.response.body.id}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "side": "buy",
    "quantity": "0.001"
}